# Records docs/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
# Needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set in your shell.
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type 'python ask.py "How quickly must a personal data breach be reported?"'
Enter
Sleep 15s

Type 'python ask.py "Does Brightline offer a free trial?"'
Enter
Sleep 12s
